  "rule": "A still stance, held as a self-state (it takes no stance slot, so it lives beside Mountain Stance). Once raised it stays for the fight: while you are Composed, the foe gains 1 Earth stack (a Weight) for 10 s every 2 s, and each hit of your companions and summons lays 1 more (once a second: the flying edges orbiting the fixed point); your Metal arts deal 4 % more for each Earth stack on the foe, with no cap. Firing a movement art ends it, and the foe keeps only half of its Earth stacks (rounded down, laid again for 10 s). Each firing counts as a formation art.",
