  "rule": "Gains a Stele charge for 12 s (a self-counter charge with its own timer: no spatial fight). Each Stele planted while others are held costs half again the linh lực of the one before (1.5 times its cost with one held, 2.25 with two, 3.375 with three, and so on; from the sixth held on, 11.4 times), so it is planted only with a fifth of your linh lực in hand. Each Stele held makes your ward hold 8 % more. While you hold two or more, each second the foe gains 1 Earth stack for 8 s and 1 Slowed Time for 2 s (the boundary line it cannot cross unfelt).",
